<title>GERMANY: Villeroy sees nine-month 96 pre-tax loss.</title>
<headline>Villeroy sees nine-month 96 pre-tax loss.</headline>
<dateline>METTLACH, Germany 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to the end of September 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax loss		     10.4 loss vs 50.2 profit</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities  21.5	vs 65.5</p>
<p>    Group sales				1,082.8   vs 1,117.6</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Tiles				     386.5     vs 381</p>
<p>     Bathroom fittings		     353.1     vs 403.3</p>
<p>     Tableware				 343.2     vs 333.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German tableware and bathroom fixtures manufacturing group is Villeroy &amp; Boch AG.</p>
</text>
